    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i totally get that, but it's like 2am and my clinic is closed until tomorrow morning. i'm just so miserable and can't even keep my eyes open. is there really no way i can just take one or two ibuprofen to get through the night? i've taken it a million times before when im not pregnant and it's always been fine. it's just a normal headache, nothing crazy right?",
